  <metadata>
    <name>Circuit du Mont-Royal · Montréal 2026</name>
    <desc>The Mont-Royal circuit of the 2026 UCI Road World Championships in Montreal, from the finish on Avenue du Parc by the George-Étienne Cartier monument: drawn along OpenStreetMap's roads through the streets of the official course map. Heights from Mapzen's terrain model (CDEM in Canada) via OpenTopoData.</desc>
